# Archive assets.
#
# `Archive Stuff/` is the raw source folder (335MB of full-resolution posters
# and photographs) and `public/media/archive/` is the derivative set built from
# it by scripts/archive-derivatives.py and scripts/archive-mockups.py.
#
# Neither is served at runtime: the seed script uploads to Sanity and the site
# renders everything from the CDN. Keeping them out stops a portfolio repo
# growing by 380MB of images that no build ever reads.
/Archive Stuff/
/public/media/archive/
